<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Extending the Learning</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00023</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Extending the Learning</md:title>
    <md:uuid>d58e43b2-da69-4303-8ead-5a0005625768</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Another way that the OpenStax Algebra 1 curriculum can help you enrich the content and differentiate for the gifted students is through the “Extending the Learning” section which occurs at the end of a activity. Students will see a button that says, “Are you Ready for More?”  These problems take a new approach to the content in ways that may ask students to think about the content in a different way or explore a different way to solve the problem.</para>
</section>
</content>
</document>
